%% Machine-learning pipeline (Mermaid)
flowchart LR
    A[Phone CSV export<br/>samples + slowdown events] --> B[Validate & clean<br/>drop/flag invalid rows,<br/>missing stays NaN]
    B --> C[Feature engineering<br/>16 features, windows 30/60/120 s,<br/>past-only]
    C --> D[Chronological split<br/>by session: 60/20/20,<br/>time-gap fallback]
    D --> E[Train Isolation Forest<br/>normal training rows only,<br/>grid search]
    E --> F[Choose threshold<br/>on validation]
    D --> G[Activity models<br/>if >= 500 rows]
    F --> H[Test evaluation<br/>vs fixed & tuned thresholds]
    G --> H
    D --> I[Early-warning experiment<br/>30/60 s horizons,<br/>refuses if data insufficient]
    F --> J[Export JSON bundle<br/>trees + imputation + baseline]
    J --> K[Parity fixtures]
    J --> L[Android assets]
    K --> M[Kotlin ModelParityTest]
    H --> N[report.md / plots]
    I --> N
